### OneSlot 공간 API 테스트 (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client)
### 관리자 토큰: POST /api/auth/login 에 admin / ADMIN_PASSWORD 로 로그인해서 받은 accessToken
@admin = 여기에_관리자_accessToken

### 1. [관리자] 공간 등록 (운영 시간을 비우면 월~일 09:00~21:00)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/spaces
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A 회의실",
  "location": "강남구",
  "capacity": 6,
  "pricePerHour": 15000,
  "description": "빔프로젝터, 화이트보드 구비",
  "operatingHours": [
    { "dayOfWeek": 1, "openTime": "09:00", "closeTime": "21:00", "closed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 2, "openTime": "09:00", "closeTime": "21:00", "closed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 3, "openTime": "09:00", "closeTime": "21:00", "closed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 4, "openTime": "09:00", "closeTime": "21:00", "closed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 5, "openTime": "09:00", "closeTime": "21:00", "closed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 6, "openTime": "10:00", "closeTime": "18:00", "closed": false },
    { "dayOfWeek": 7, "closed": true }
  ]
}

### 2. [관리자] 목록 (비활성 포함)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/spaces?keyword=회의실
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 3. [관리자] 비활성으로 숨기기
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/admin/spaces/1/active
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "active": false }

### 4. [관리자] 사진 올리기 (form-data, 키 files)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/spaces/1/images
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="room.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./room.png
--b--

### 5. 검색 (로그인 없이). 12/1(화) 10:00~12:00, 4명
GET http://localhost:8080/api/spaces?date=2026-12-01&start=10:00&end=12:00&people=4&sort=price_asc

### 6. 메인 인기 공간
GET http://localhost:8080/api/spaces/popular

### 7. 공간 상세
GET http://localhost:8080/api/spaces/1

### 8. 그날 운영 시간 (12/5 토 → 10:00~18:00, 12/6 일 → 휴무)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/spaces/1/hours?date=2026-12-05
